  "item_short_desc": "<p>Elevate your tactical gear with Rothco&rsquo;s Adjustable BDU Belt, a rugged and versatile accessory designed to withstand the demands of intense missions. Crafted from resilient yet lightweight material, this fully adjustable belt ensures durability and comfort, making it ideal for active-duty personnel and security. Whether you need to carry essential tools or gear, this belt will reliably support your gear while holding up your fatigue or tactical pants.</p>",
  "no_ratings": "0",
